 Mary before Tyn in Prague’s Old Town, and other Gothic churches in Kolin and Kutna Hora. A new stone\xa0bridge\xa0replaced the Judita\xa0bridge, joining Prague’s Old Town with the Lesser Quarter beneath the castle.”'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 879, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 824})
